id: pmc-hox8
title: "Suppressed pending release can relocate or drop an item (Greptile issue 2, PR #174)"
description: "Greptile review on PR #174 (confidence 3/5): When tagged history contains an item declaring the suppressed placeholder version, with a completion time at or before the newest real tag, removing the pending window leaves no matching release identity. The timestamp fallback then renders that item under an older real release, and section narrowing can drop it entirely. So suppressing a phantom release can silently attribute work to a real past release or lose it."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: bug,greptile,pr-174
created_at: "2026-08-31T11:19:54.090Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-31T11:24:28.465Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-31T11:24:28.443Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-31T11:24:28.443Z"
author: pi-agent
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "Orphaned release items land under Unreleased, not older releases, and survive section narrowing"
actual_result: Fixed assignItemsToReleaseWindows; three revert-proof tests pass
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-31T11:23:34.180Z",pi-agent,"Fixed: assignItemsToReleaseWindows now routes items whose declared release matches no window to the Unreleased section, preventing relocation to older releases and omission by section narrowing. Three revert-proof tests: relocated-to-older-release, omitted-by-narrowing (with --since-version), and correct Unreleased placement."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  src/generator.ts,project,Fixed assignItemsToReleaseWindows to route orphaned release items to Unreleased
  test/generator.test.ts,project,"Added three tests for relocate,narrowing,and correct Unreleased placement"
tests[3]{command,path,scope,note}:
  "npx tsx --test --test-name-pattern \"suppressed pending release does not relocate\" test/generator.test.ts",test/generator.test.ts,project,suppressed pending release does not relocate a declared item into an older real release
  "npx tsx --test --test-name-pattern \"suppressed pending release does not drop\" test/generator.test.ts",test/generator.test.ts,project,suppressed pending release does not drop a declared item narrowed out of an older release section
  "npx tsx --test --test-name-pattern \"an item declaring a non-existent release\" test/generator.test.ts",test/generator.test.ts,project,"an item declaring a non-existent release lands under Unreleased, not an older release"
close_reason: Fixed and verified
